Package: libmajoris-image-1
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, majoris-image-worker (= ${binary:Version})
Description: shared sandboxed image processing library
 Majoris Image provides asynchronous image opening, metadata, floating-point
 image data, region rendering, export and headless PNG thumbnail generation.

Package: libmajoris-image-gtk4-1
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: glycin-loaders
Description: reusable Majoris Image GTK4 widget
 MajorisImageView presents images with zoom, pan, rotation, page navigation
 and optional Glycin animation. Applications can construct it with GtkBuilder.

Package: majoris-image-worker
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, bubblewrap, util-linux
Recommends: libheif-plugin-libde265, libheif-plugin-dav1d
Suggests: gvfs-backends
Description: isolated Majoris Image decoding worker
 Runs native codec, colour-management and image-processing operations inside
 the sandbox created by the Majoris Image core library.

Package: majoris-image-thumbnailer
Section: graphics
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: desktop thumbnail generator using Majoris Image
 Generates colour-managed PNG thumbnails for supported image formats using
 the Majoris Image worker.

Package: libmajoris-image-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libmajoris-image-1 (= ${binary:Version}),
 libmajoris-image-gtk4-1 (= ${binary:Version}), libglib2.0-dev, libgtk-4-dev
Description: Majoris Image public development interfaces
 C headers, Vala bindings, pkg-config metadata and examples for the Majoris
 Image core and GTK4 libraries.
